From 382ecdbe86d0ae24f07bae98fa79257349d9e04f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jack Kingston <998656+jkingston@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:26:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] feat(allwinner): add dormant A133 suspend orchestrator

Add the stock-matched CPU_OP 3/3/3 and RESTORE_NOTIFY transaction as a
serialized, default-off state machine. Keep PSCI SYSTEM_SUSPEND
disconnected and fail closed across ambiguous transport outcomes.

Assisted-by: LLM
